@	
s	activate	Activate Streamlit by entering your email
s	cache	Manage the Streamlit cache
s	config	Manage Streamlit's config settings
s	docs	Show help in browser
s	hello	Runs the Hello World script
s	help	Print the help message
s	run	Run a Python script, piping stderr to Streamlit
s	version	Print Streamlit's version number
o	--log_level	Set the log level	v
o	--help	Show a help message and exit	
o	--version	Show the version and exit	
=		--log_level
v	error	
v	warning	
v	info	
v	debug	
@	activate
@	cache
s	clear	Clear st.cache, st.memo, and st.singleton caches
@	cache clear
@	config
s	show	Show all of Streamlit's config settings
@	config show
@	docs
@	hello
@	help
@	run
a	1	0
#	run	1
d
@	version
